serted"><!----><!----> Soft blush-pink tulips with subtle white feather accents. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Minimal, luxurious, graceful and romantic. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Avoid overcrowding the design with too many flowers. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Use elegant, readable romantic typography. <!----><!----></li><!----></ul><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> INTERACTIVE ENVELOPE <!----><!----></p><!----><ul _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-list ng-star-inserted"><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Show a beautiful closed wedding envelope in the center of the screen. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> The envelope must be visually obvious and look realistic, with visible front folds and a triangular closing flap. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Use ivory/cream paper with subtle champagne-gold borders. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Add a beautiful gold wax seal in the center of the flap. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Add delicate blush-pink tulip and white feather decorations. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Make the envelope look elegant and premium. <!----><!----></li><!----></ul><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> OPENING ANIMATION <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> When the visitor taps the envelope: <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><ol _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-numbered-list ng-star-inserted"><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> The envelope flap smoothly opens upward. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> The invitation card slides gracefully out of the envelope. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Small blush-pink flower petals scatter and gently flutter around the screen. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> The invitation card appears clearly in the center. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Use smooth, romantic animations, not fast or distracting effects. <!----><!----></li><!----></ol><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Add a close/reopen interaction so visitors can close the invitation and open it again. <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> EXACT INVITATION TEXT <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Do not change, rewrite, shorten, or add titles to the names. <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> With love in their hearts <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> and joy in their souls, <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Yoon Nadi Zaw &amp; Chan Min Khant <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> invite you to witness <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> the beginning of their forever. <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> A day of love, laughter and beautiful memories <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> WEDDING DETAILS <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Saturday, 05 December 2026 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> 7:00 AM – 11:00 AM <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Do not add a venue or any extra names. <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> MOBILE RESPONSIVENESS <!----><!----></p><!----><ul _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-list ng-star-inserted"><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Must look beautiful on Android phones and iPhones. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Fit different screen sizes without cutting off any content. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Make the envelope easy to tap. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Ensure all animations work smoothly on mobile. <!----><!----></li><!----></ul><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS <!----><!----></p><!----><ul _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-list ng-star-inserted"><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Build a complete working website using HTML, CSS and JavaScript. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Put everything into a single index.html file. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Do not provide only a screenshot or static image. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> All envelope animations and petal effects must actually work. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Do not use paid services or require a subscription. <!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Help me publish the finished website online for free and obtain a public shareable URL that friends can open without downloading anything. <!----><!----></li><!----></ul><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Before finishing, test that the envelope opens, the invitation appears, the petals animate, and the close/reopen interaction works. <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2353902557="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> The final result must be a real interactive wedding invitation website, not just a design preview. <!----><!----></