3841846924="" _nghost-ng-c3881391001=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c3881391001="" class="model-response-text is-mobile processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2523793841="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2523793841="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2523793841="" _nghost-ng-c4155962219="" id="message-content-id-r_0cffc86fc694e6d0" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4155962219="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_0cffc86fc694e6d0" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0" class="pending"><span class="pending">I will now generate the single-file digital wedding invitation web application containing the realistic interactive envelope,</span><span class="pending"> 3D opening animation,</span><span class="pending"> fluttering blush-pink petal canvas physics,</span><span class="pending"> exact requested invitation text,</span><span class="pending"> wedding countdown timer,</span><span class="pending"> ambient music toggle,</span><span class="pending"> calendar integration,</span><span class="pending"> RSVP modal,</span><span class="pending"> and step-by-step hosting guide.</span></p><div class="attachment-container unknown md-has-block-component pending"><response-element class="no-md pending" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><immersive-entry-chip _nghost-ng-c2972443478="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><gem-processing-card _ngcontent-ng-c2972443478="" _nghost-ng-c362960281="" jslog="275420;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W251bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsWyJjZjQxYjBlMGRkN2Q1M2U1Il0sbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLFtdXQ==" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="completed ng-star-inserted selected" data-hveid="3"><div _ngcontent-ng-c362960281="" class="container"><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c362960281="" size="xlarge" class="status-icon" _nghost-ng-c1382757320=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1382757320="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-xl lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="code_blocks" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="code_blocks"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><span _ngcontent-ng-c362960281="" class="card-title gds-body-l">Digital Wedding Invitation</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c362960281="" class="body-area"><span _ngcontent-ng-c362960281="" class="current-step gds-body-s ng-star-inserted">5 Nov, 12:39</span><!----><!----></div><!----></div></gem-processing-card><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></immersive-entry-chip><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div><p data-path-to-node="2" class="pending"><span class="pending">I have generated the interactive digital wedding invitation website in a single file (</span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="86" class="pending">index.html</code><span class="pending">).</span></p><h3 data-path-to-node="3" class="pending">Key Highlights &amp; Features Included:</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4" class="pending"><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0" class="pending"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" class="pending">Design &amp; Aesthetic:</b><span class="pending"> Styled with warm ivory/cream tones (</span><code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="56" class="pending">#FAF7F2</code><span class="pending">),</span><span class="pending"> delicate champagne-gold accents,</span><span class="pending"> soft blush-pink tulips,</span><span class="pending"> and white feather SVG accents with romantic typography (</span><code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="179" class="pending">Cormorant Garamond</code><span class="pending"> and </span><code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="202" class="pending">Alex Brush</code><span class="pending">).</span></p></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0" class="pending"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" class="pending">Interactive Envelope &amp; 3D Animation:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,1,1" class="pending"><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0,0" class="pending"><span class="pending">A realistic closed envelope with folded paper geometry and a wax seal stamped with </span><code data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="83" class="pending">Y &amp; C</code><span class="pending">.</span></p></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,1,0" class="pending"><span class="pending">On tap,</span><span class="pending"> the flap flips open (</span><code data-path-to-node="4,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="29" class="pending">rotateX(180deg)</code><span class="pending">),</span><span class="pending"> and the invitation card glides gracefully up.</span></p></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,2,0" class="pending"><span class="pending">Fluttering blush-pink tulip petals scatter dynamically across an HTML5 Canvas.</span></p></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,3,0" class="pending"><span class="pending">A </span><b data-path-to-node="4,1,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="2" class="pending">Fold Back Into Envelope</b><span class="pending"> control allows visitors to close and reopen the envelope anytime.</span></p></li></ul></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0" class="pending"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" class="pending">Exact Requested Text &amp; Details:</b><span class="pending"> Preserved the exact text for Yoon Nadi Zaw &amp; Chan Min Khant without alterations,</span><span class="pending"> venue additions,</span><span class="pending"> or extra titles.</span></p></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,3,0" class="pending"><b data-path-to-node="4,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" class="pending">Additional Interactive Enhancements:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,3,1" class="pending"><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,3,1,0,0" class="pending"><span class="pending">Live Countdown Timer targeting Saturday,</span><span class="pending"> December 5,</span><span class="pending"> 2026 at 07:</span><span class="pending">00 AM.</span></p></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,3,1,1,0" class="pending"><span class="pending">RSVP &amp; Best Wishes modal popup.</span></p></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,3,1,2,0" class="pending"><span class="pending">Soft Romantic Piano Audio Synthesizer toggle (Web Audio API fallback to ensure smooth audio playback across browsers).</span></p></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,3,1,3,0" class="pending"><span class="pending">"Add to Calendar" button for guests.</span></p></li></ul></li><li class="pending"><p data-path-to-node="4,4,0" class="pending"><b data-path-to-node="4,4,0" data-index-in-node="0" class="pending">Free Publishing Instructions:</b><span class="pending"> Built-in collapsible accordion at the bottom explaining how to host for free on GitHub Pages,</span><span class="pending"> Netlify,</span><span class="pending"> or Vercel to get a shareable URL.</span></p></li></ol></div></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3841846924="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c3841846924="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c3841846924="" _nghost-ng-c3733613330="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c3841846924="" _nghost-ng-c446528241="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c3841846924="" _nghost-ng-c1938452387="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1919826681="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1919826681-29 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c3841846924="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3123565186-30 ng-tns-c1919826681-29 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3123565186=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3123565186="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3123565186-30 mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3123565186="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3123565186-30 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3123565186="" _nghost-ng-c977495440="" class="ng-tns-c3123565186-30 luminous-theme ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c977495440="" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="Good response" gemtooltip="Good response" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button